    conditions:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 80691bccb6fea744ba2c5987bd9c4618, type: 2}
  nodes:
  - id: offer
    text: An expedition runs on preparation. Two logs for the fire, one piece of
      copper for repairs. After that, we'll see to the medicine. Can you lend a hand?
    responses:
    - text: I'll bring the supplies.
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 041f8a156f8c4534ba439b3472f12ce0, type: 2}
      conditions:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: eeac61dbad89cc0429f81484d61b119e, type: 2}
    - text: Maybe later.
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b04bc50ce9793c045abd69ada89442c3, type: 2}
      conditions: []
  - id: supplies
    text: Two logs and one copper ore. The trees and copper rocks are close by. I
      need the supplies in your bag before I can put them to work.
    responses:
    - text: Here are the logs and copper.
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6bdc75988e6081c4c920ab28b195f5f6, type: 2}
      conditions:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a905d9d9253fbd4aacd9dc0bda44010, type: 2}
    - text: I'll return with the supplies.
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b04bc50ce9793c045abd69ada89442c3, type: 2}
      conditions: []
  - id: draught
    text: 'That will keep the fire burning and the tools in one piece. One last thing:
      a healing potion from the spring. Bring it back and I''ll restock your medicine
      pouch.'
    responses:
    - text: Here is the healing potion.
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d8a20724582227849ad631690d200ecb, type: 2}
      conditions:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e38c6557d9e244468f1f5abe8e7f4b0, type: 2}
    - text: I'll fetch the potion.
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b04bc50ce9793c045abd69ada89442c3, type: 2}
      conditions: []
  - id: complete
    text: Firewood stacked, tools repaired, medicine packed. That's an expedition
      ready to leave. Take these potions, and thank you for seeing the job through.
    responses:
    - text: Safe travels, Nessa.
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b04bc50ce9793c045abd69ada89442c3, type: 2}
      conditions: []
